&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Fullstack Web Developer to join our Web Apps team, in our Zürich office. In this role you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The web apps team plays a central role at Auterion and owns the systems that add connectivity and remote interfaces for fleet management and operations. Our services are responsible for ingesting and analyzing flight telemetry data, managing and updating the fleet as well as integrating with other systems across the stack.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across all the team’s web based projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate services between edge devices and our centralized services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle new feature discovery, prototyping and investigations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Customer Success team in debugging and resolving customer issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze user usage patterns and other statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push initiatives to clean up, upgrade, and refactor existing services to reduce technical debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve integrations with 3rd party services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in a Fullstack web development or similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with the Node.js&amp;nbsp; ecosystem, development and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with the Typescript ecosystem, development and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with modern SPAs (Vue.js ecosystem preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Postgres/SQL (queries, transactions, views, indexes, triggers) as well as ORM systems (Prisma)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Docker and container orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with CI/CD pipelines (GoCD and GH Actions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with monitoring and observability tools (Datadog, Grafana)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python proficiency is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CH/EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The Rubrik Engineering team is comprised of people who produce extraordinary results. Our engineers are driven to build efficient, reliable, and cost-effective products. We believe in empowering our teams, giving engineers autonomy and responsibility, not just tasks. Our goal is to motivate and challenge you to do the best work of your career. As part of the Rubrik Engineering team, you will work closely with product managers, designers, and other engineers to define the next generation of products for Rubrik. At Rubrik, nothing will stop you from thinking big. We are looking for individuals who are comfortable with ambiguity and excited by the prospect of a challenge. If you have a positive attitude, high energy and limitless drive, and like to win, we want to talk to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Solutions Architect is a key sales specialist who brings deep technical expertise to the broader sales organisation. You will work with customers &amp;amp; prospects to educate how Rubrik protects and manages data across the enterprise estate, from virtualisation, physical servers, NAS, and databases to cloud, SaaS, and identity. You will own the technical side of the sale from first conversation to validated decision. That includes running proof of concept, producing technical documentation, diagrams and guiding complex, multi-stakeholder discussions.&amp;nbsp;You will also bring field insight back to Product and Engineering, test features before release, and help enable the wider sales team. Your technical credibility and influence with customers will drive results now and shape the product over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical conversations, in person and remote, with audiences from practitioners to executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with account teams to run in-depth discovery to connect technical capabilities to customer pain, risk, and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide complex engagements that involve several teams and competing priorities, such as infrastructure, applications, database, cloud, security, identity, and compliance. Build consensus among them and handle objections and competitive pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical win. Agree POC scope and success criteria with the customer, plan and deliver the POC, resolve blockers, and present results that support the business case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with technical implementation and validation of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design resilient backup, recovery, and cyber resilience architectures across hybrid and multi-cloud environments. Workloads include:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hypervisors and virtualized infrastructure (VMware, Hyper-V, Nutanix AHV). Physical servers (Windows, Linux). NAS and unstructured data. Enterprise databases (Oracle, SQL Server, and others). Public cloud workloads (AWS, Azure, GCP, OCI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on identity resilience and integration with identity providers (Entra, AD, Okta, Ping).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for automation through Infrastructure as Code and APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales and field enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with sales teams from initial discovery through technical validation, contributing to deal strategy and competitive positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and deliver presentations that enable systems engineers, and act as a technical resource for opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Management and Engineering to find and address product gaps, bringing real-world insight from POCs and customer deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote position with approximately 50% travel for onsite meetings, as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend internal meetings and events, in person and remote, as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in enterprise data protection, infrastructure, or a closely related focus area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with backup, high availability, and disaster recovery for enterprise workloads such as virtualization, physical servers, NAS, and databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering customer POCs or technical validations in complex enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing senior technical and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of at least one major cloud platform (AWS, Azure, or GCP), including identity, networking, and security fundamentals. Knowledge of identity providers (Entra, AD, Okta) is also valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting experience in a relevant language (Python, PowerShell, Bash, etc.). Terraform or similar IaC experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience giving technical presentations to small and large audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage your own time and projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
